14-0046\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please push the tugboat task to wednesday?\", \"Would you mind starring the clipboard document for me?\", \"Could you please add call with the bank to my calendar on friday at half four?\"], [\"push the tugboat thing to wednesday pls\", \"also star the clipboard document\", \"oh and put call with the bank in my calendar friday at half four thx\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0047\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to remember when we were last out that way, so is there anything in my calendar at Antibes Common?\", \"I'd love to look back at that day, so can you pull up the photos from there?\", \"That's a lovely one and I'm putting together a year highlights thing, so could you add it to the Best of 2027 album?\"], [\"uh is there, like, a calendar event at Antibes Common?\", \"ok can you show me the photos from there?\", \"oh nice, umm put that one in the Best of 2027 album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0048\", \"v\": [[\"umm who do I… who do I owe money to right now?\", \"ok and do I have a photo of any of them?\"], [\"who do I owe?\", \"photos of any of them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0049\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me if anything is happening on friday?\", \"Would you mind telling me who's coming to the collect one?\", \"And next friday, please?\"], [\"so is there anything going on friday?\", \"ok the collect one… who's, uh, who's coming to that?\", \"hmm and next friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0050\", \"v\": [[\"note: things to pack for the Norhaven trip\", \"friend from antenatal — which contact?\"], [\"I always forget half my stuff when I travel, so could you jot down a note that says things to pack for the Norhaven trip?\", \"Different thing — I've got someone saved but can't remember the name, so which of my contacts is my friend from antenatal?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0051\", \"v\": [[\"ok so can you… settle up with Dagmar in the, um, the Antibes trip?\"], [\"settle up with Dagmar, Antibes trip\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0052\", \"v\": [[\"Antibes trip: five dollars, Dagmar's tickets, I paid\"], [\"Could you please add five dollars for Dagmar's tickets to the Antibes trip? I paid for it.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0053\", \"v\": [[\"replace to tomorrow, fermenting to next monday\"], [\"umm can you move the replace task to tomorrow and, uh, the fermenting one to next monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0054\", \"v\": [[\"I texted Priel earlier — could you please log that for me?\", \"Sorry, my mistake, it was actually Eamon, not them.\"], [\"texted Priel, log it\", \"no, Eamon, not them\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0055\", \"v\": [[\"whats left to do on the clean the fish tank (wk 23) plan\", \"which of those got no due date\"], [\"clean the fish tank (wk 23) — what's left?\", \"which undated?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0056\", \"v\": [[\"I want to fill some gaps in my week with the loose stuff, so which of my open tasks don't have a date on them yet?\", \"Actually I've got a bit of time for the labelling bits specifically, so which of those are about label?\"], [\"which open todos have no date\", \"which of those r about label\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0057\", \"v\": [[\"anything tomorrow?\", \"and the 9th?\", \"restore the jetty note I deleted\"], [\"umm is anything happening tomorrow?\", \"ok and what about… the 9th?\", \"oh and, uh, I deleted the jetty note by accident, can you put it back?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w14-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Dagmar's been nudging me about what I owe from the holiday and I'd rather just clear it, so could you settle up with Dagmar in Antibes?\"], [\"uh can you settle up with Dagmar in… in Antibes?\"]]}","ttft_ms":7025,"type":"result","duration_ms":20778,"uuid":"105edf9f-c0c0-475d-940a-a95a3979ca85","ttft_stream_ms":1270,"time_to_request_ms":136,"first_content_frame_ms":1270,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22070463,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278621017.1584,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
